  "subtitle": "Dr Dagny Okafor and Evaluation of Evaluation",
  "summary": "Dr Dagny Okafor, Lecturer and Convenor of Evaluation of Evaluation, sets out in her own words the program's interest in the checks an institution runs on itself, from a warehouse's food-safety tick box to a committee's signed minutes and a line manager's approval click, and in what those checks change. Along the way the video notes that her lead-authored paper on the tick box is among the three most cited outputs in the University's research repository, and that she holds the Deposit of the Quarter Prize.",
